        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Steal Breath"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, necromancy, occult)\n\nRequirements: The kurobozu is adjacent to a living creature that is paralyzed, slowed, stunned, or unconscious\n\nThe kurobozu leans over and sucks the breath from the target, who must attempt a 22 Fortitude save. Regardless of the result, the creature is exposed to black apoxia and its breath reeks of carrion for 1 minute.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature can't speak for 1 minute.\n- **Failure:** The creature becomes sickened 2 and can't speak for 1 minute.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, plus the creature falls unconscious and begins suffocating."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
